4444,"impressionShareLostBudget":38,"impressionShareLostRank":19,"raw":{"Period":"Current","Campaign":"Shopping - Top Sellers","Campaign type":"Shopping","Impressions":34000,"Clicks":1800,"Cost":2400,"Conversions":62,"Conversion value":15500,"Search lost IS (budget)":38,"Search lost IS (rank)":19}},{"campaign":"Search - Brand","campaignType":"Search","impressions":12000,"clicks":1550,"spend":820,"conversions":92,"conversionValue":13200,"ctr":0.12916666666666668,"avgCpc":0.5290322580645161,"cpa":8.91304347826087,"roas":16.097560975609756,"conversionRate":0.05935483870967742,"impressionShareLostBudget":8,"impressionShareLostRank":12,"raw":{"Period":"Current","Campaign":"Search - Brand","Campaign type":"Search","Impressions":12000,"Clicks":1550,"Cost":820,"Conversions":92,"Conversion value":13200,"Search lost IS (budget)":8,"Search lost IS (rank)":12}}]},"painpoints":[{"title":"Display - Remarketing has weak click-through rate","severity":"medium","evidence":"CTR is 1.3% versus an account average of 3.5%.","recommendation":"Tighten targeting, split mixed intent, and refresh ad copy around the strongest commercial hook.","section":"performance"},{"title":"Display - Remarketing pays for clicks that do not turn into demand","severity":"high","evidence":"900 clicks produced a 0.4% conversion rate at €1 average CPC.","recommendation":"Review search intent and the landing page together; the issue is probably not solved by bids alone.","section":"cro"},{"title":"Informational search terms are consuming budget","severity":"medium","evidence":"Examples: best running shoes guide, free shoe size chart, how to clean sneakers.","recommendation":"Add negatives for clear research intent and isolate discovery terms from bottom-funnel campaigns.","section":"search_terms"},{"title":"PMax needs more segmentation before scaling","severity":"medium","evidence":"PMax - All Products has 1.3 ROAS on €5,200 spend.","recommendation":"Break out product/category performance, check feed quality, and separate proven winners from testing inventory.","section":"budget"},{"title":"Traffic volume is not translating into ecommerce conversion rate","severity":"high","evidence":"The uploads show meaningful click volume with weak purchase conversion rate.","recommendation":"Audit product pages, price competitiveness, delivery promises, reviews, and checkout friction before buying more traffic.","section":"cro"},{"title":"Search - Brand looks underfunded","severity":"low","evidence":"16.1 ROAS with only €820 spend.","recommendation":"Increase budget gradually while watching marginal CPA/ROAS, search lost IS, and impression-share ceilings.","section":"budget"},{"title":"Profitable demand is being capped by budget","severity":"medium","evidence":"Shopping - Top Sellers reports 38% lost impression share by budget.","recommendation":"Move budget from low-return campaigns before increasing total spend.","section":"budget"},{"title":"Ranking losses point to relevance, quality, or bid pressure","severity":"medium","evidence":"Search - Non Brand reports 44% lost impression share by rank.","recommendation":"Improve ad relevance and landing-page alignment before simply pushing CPCs higher.","section":"performance"}],"executiveSummary":["This report is written in English, with a direct PPC strategist tone.","For Sample Client, the commercial picture is: €13,100 spend, 8950 clicks, 3.5% CTR, 227.0 conversions, €58 CPA and 3.3 ROAS. Spend moved 20.0%, conversions -1.7% and ROAS -15.8% versus the comparison period.","The main blockers are display - remarketing has weak click-through rate, display - remarketing pays for clicks that do not turn into demand, informational search terms are consuming budget, pmax needs more segmentation before scaling. These are the areas most likely to affect profit, lead quality, or scaling confidence.","Strategist note: Focus on profitable scaling and clean search intent."],"performanceNarrative":["Current period: April 2026. Previous period: Previous.","The account generated 8950 clicks from 254000 impressions at 3.5% CTR. Average CPC is €1 and conversion rate is 2.5%.","Compared with the previous period, spend changed by 20.0%, conversions by -1.7%, CPA by 22.1% and ROAS by -15.8%. The key question is whether extra spend is buying better demand or simply more volume."],"campaignBudgetAnalysis":["Best performers: Shopping - Top Sellers (€2,400 spend, 62.0 conversions, 6.5 ROAS); Search - Brand (€820 spend, 92.0 conversions, 16.1 ROAS); Search - Non Brand (€3,900 spend, 38.0 conversions, 1.8 ROAS).","Campaigns needing attention: Display - Remarketing (€780 spend, 4.0 conversions); PMax - All Products (€5,200 spend, 31.0 conversions); Search - Non Brand (€3,900 spend, 38.0 conversions).","Budget should follow clean intent and measurable return. At account level, ROAS is 3.3. Search and Shopping deserve separate scrutiny from PMax because they expose intent and product economics more clearly."],"searchTermsIntentAnalysis":["High-intent terms to protect or expand: brand name shoes, buy running shoes, premium trail shoes. These terms show the clearest route from query to commercial action.","Negative keyword review candidates: best running shoes guide, free shoe size chart, how to clean sneakers. These terms spent money without visible conversion output.","Expansion should come from converting queries, close variants with buyer language, and themes where landing pages can answer the intent without forcing the visitor to work."],"changeHistoryHygiene":["4 change-history rows were uploaded. Review changes around the dates where spend, CPA, or ROAS moved most sharply.","A healthy account has enough change history to prove active management, but not so much noise that every test overlaps with another test.","No major conversion tracking issue was automatically detected, but imported conversion names and counting settings should still be checked manually."],"croNotes":["Website notes uploaded: The homepage has a clear CTA, but the product pages bury delivery information below the fold. Reviews are visible only near the bottom of the page. Mobile checkout has four steps and the discount code field is more prominent than the payment button.\n","For ecommerce, review product-page trust, delivery clarity, pricing, review depth, variant availability, checkout steps, and whether PMax/Shopping traffic lands on the right category or product."],"nextSteps":[{"action":"Tighten targeting, split mixed intent, and refresh ad copy around the strongest commercial hook.","impact":4,"effort":2,"type":"quick_win"},{"action":"Review search intent and the landing page together; the issue is probably not solved by bids alone.","impact":5,"effort":4,"type":"strategic"},{"action":"Add negatives for clear research intent and isolate discovery terms from bottom-funnel campaigns.","impact":4,"effort":2,"type":"quick_win"},{"action":"Break out product/category performance, check feed quality, and separate proven winners from testing inventory.","impact":4,"effort":2,"type":"quick_win"},{"action":"Audit product pages, price competitiveness, delivery promises, reviews, and checkout friction before buying more traffic.","impact":5,"effort":4,"type":"strategic"},{"action":"Increase budget gradually while watching marginal CPA/ROAS, search lost IS, and impression-share ceilings.","impact":3,"effort":2,"type":"quick_win"},{"action":"Move budget from low-return campaigns before increasing total spend.","impact":4,"effort":2,"type":"quick_win"},{"action":"Improve ad relevance and landing-page alignment before simply pushing CPCs higher.","impact":4,"effort":2,"type":"quick_win"},{"action":"Create a weekly optimization log that links budget, query, bid, and landing-page changes to performance movement.","impact":4,"effort":2,"type":"quick_win"}]},"parsedFiles":[{"slot":"google_ads_campaigns","fileName":"google_ads_campaigns.csv","rows":10},{"slot":"google_ads_search_terms","fileName":"google_ads_search_terms.csv","rows":6},{"slot":"google_ads_keywords","fileName":"google_ads_keywords.csv","rows":4},{"slot":"google_ads_change_history","fileName":"google_ads_change_history.csv","rows":4},{"slot":"google_ads_conversions","fileName":"google_ads_conversions.csv","rows":4},{"slot":"google_ads_assets","fileName":"google_ads_assets.csv","rows":4},{"slot":"ga4_pages","fileName":"ga4_pages.csv","rows":4},{"slot":"ga4_events","fileName":"ga4_events.csv","rows":5},{"slot":"search_console_queries","fileName":"search_console_queries.csv","rows":4},{"slot":"website_notes","fileName":"website_notes.txt","rows":1}],"docxBase64":"","fileName":"sample-client-google-ads-audit.docx"}